te changes.\n\nCalling setState synchronously within an effect body causes cascading renders that can hurt performance, and is not recommended. (https://react.dev/learn/you-might-not-need-an-effect).\n\n/home/gabriel/Documentos/EnergyOS/src/components/dashboard/focus-timer.tsx:421:7\n  419 |   useEffect(() => {\n  420 |     if (typeof window !== \"undefined\" && \"Notification\" in window) {\n> 421 |       setNotifPermission(Notification.permission);\n      |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ Avoid calling setState() directly within an effect\n  422 |     }\n  423 |   }, []);\n  424 |","'imageSize' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'completeSession' and 'syncRemaining'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["2304"],["2305"],"'DragEndEvent' is defined but never used.",["2306"],"'Tag' is defined but never used.",["2307"],"'Clock' is defined but never used.",["2308"],"'categoryIcon' is defined but never used.",["2309"],"'onMove' is defined but never used.","'onUpdate' is defined but never used.","react-hooks/preserve-manual-memoization","Compilation Skipped: Existing memoization could not be preserved\n\nReact Compiler has skipped optimizing this component because the existing manual memoization could not be preserved. The inferred dependencies did not match the manually specified dependencies, which could cause the value to change more or less frequently than expected. The inferred dependency was `setEditedTask`, but the source dependencies were []. Inferred dependency not present in source.\n\n/home/gabriel/Documentos/EnergyOS/src/components/dashboard/kanban-board.tsx:586:41\n  584 |   const [newLabelColor, setNewLabelColor] = useState(\"#71d4ff\");\n  585 |   const [creatingLabel, setCreatingLabel] = useState(false);\n> 586 |   const setReferenceImage = useCallback((imageUrl: string | null, imagePath: string | null) => {\n      |                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^